# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (looks like G-1A2BCD3EFG).
# Leave this empty until you have a real ID.
# The gtag script is NOT added to the page unless the visitor presses Accept
# on the cookie banner. Reject never loads Google Analytics.
# Vercel Web Analytics is cookieless and is wired separately (@vercel/analytics);
# it only reports once the site is hosted on Vercel.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
